#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1327
msgid "Strings"
msgstr "Strings"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1327
msgid "Immutable - every method returns a new string; `String(x ?? \"\")` before calling methods"
msgstr "Immutable - всеки метод връща нов string; `String(x ?? \"\")` преди да извиквате методи"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1329
msgid "Older forms"
msgstr "По-стари форми"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1329
msgid "`indexOf(...) !== -1`, `substring`, `substr` (deprecated), `charAt` - read them, write the modern form"
msgstr "`indexOf(...) !== -1`, `substring`, `substr` (deprecated), `charAt` - четете ги, пишете модерната форма"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1330
msgid "Wrappers"
msgstr "Обвивки"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1330
msgid "`\"a\".toUpperCase()` works by boxing; never `new String` / `new Number` / `new Boolean`"
msgstr "`\"a\".toUpperCase()` работи чрез boxing; никога `new String` / `new Number` / `new Boolean`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1331
msgid "Encoding"
msgstr "Кодиране"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1331
msgid "Characters are code points; UTF-8 in files (1-4 bytes); `length` counts code units; `\\r\\n` vs `\\n` - split with `/\\r?\\n/`"
msgstr "Символите са code points; UTF-8 във файловете (1-4 байта); `length` брои code units; `\\r\\n` срещу `\\n` - разделяйте с `/\\r?\\n/`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1332
msgid "Regex"
msgstr "Regex"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1332
msgid "`/pattern/flags`; `\\d \\w \\s .`, `[...]`, `* + ? {n,m}`, `^ $ \\b`, `( )`, `\\|`; test it on regex101"
msgstr "`/pattern/flags`; `\\d \\w \\s .`, `[...]`, `* + ? {n,m}`, `^ $ \\b`, `( )`, `\\|`; изпробвайте го в regex101"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1333
msgid "Methods with regex"
msgstr "Методи с regex"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1333
msgid "`test` (true / false), `match` (groups or `null`), `matchAll` (all, with groups), `replace` (`$1`, a function), `split`"
msgstr "`test` (true / false), `match` (групи или `null`), `matchAll` (всички, с групите), `replace` (`$1`, функция), `split`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1334
msgid "`g` all, `i` ignore case, `m` multiline; never `g` with `test`"
msgstr "`g` всички, `i` без значение малки или главни, `m` многоредов режим; никога `g` с `test`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1335
msgid "Versions"
msgstr "Версии"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1335
msgid "Normalise every format to dotted numbers, then `compareVersions` - one helper in the library"
msgstr "Нормализирайте всеки формат до числа с точки, после `compareVersions` - една helper функция в библиотеката"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1336
msgid "Numbers"
msgstr "Числа"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1336
msgid "`Number(\"\")` is 0; `Number.isNaN`, `Number.isFinite`; `toFixed` gives a string; long ids stay strings"
msgstr "`Number(\"\")` е 0; `Number.isNaN`, `Number.isFinite`; `toFixed` дава string; дългите id-та остават strings"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1338
msgid "Dates"
msgstr "Дати"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1338
msgid "Milliseconds since 1970 UTC; EPOCH seconds * 1000; months from 0; `toISOString()` for UTC text"
msgstr "Милисекунди от 1970 г. UTC; EPOCH в секунди * 1000; месеците от 0; `toISOString()` за текст в UTC"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1339
msgid "Parsing dates"
msgstr "Разчитане на дати"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1339
msgid "Only ISO is reliable; other formats: regex + `Date.UTC`; check `Number.isNaN(d.getTime())`"
msgstr "Само ISO е надежден; другите формати: regex + `Date.UTC`; проверявайте `Number.isNaN(d.getTime())`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1340
msgid "Date math"
msgstr "Сметки с дати"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/08-strings-regex-dates.md:1340
msgid "`b - a` gives ms; 1 day = 86,400,000 ms; compare with `<` or `getTime()`"
msgstr "`b - a` дава ms; 1 ден = 86 400 000 ms; сравнявайте с `<` или `getTime()`"

